From 607596401dafa1208fcfedabcfdcfa6ff7e23851 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: downstream <downstream@local>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 17:42:35 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Codex Responses compatibility and stream lifecycle

Consolidated from the following original patches (file custody by final owner):

- original #05: 0005 codex-responses-compatibility
- original #26: Propagate native stream failures through every terminal path
- original #40: Split native SSE events on bare CR and share the provider
- original #68: Strip legacy Codex reasoning IDs on replay
